{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dreamy adventure begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maid, dozing off during her break, finds herself in a mysterious dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Up Step Maid</i> is a 2D action game where you use three types of jumps to make your way through whimsical stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump through with three types of jumps</strong><br>If you press the jump button again just as you land from a normal jump, you'll perform a &quot;mid-jump.&quot;<br>Land from a mid-jump and press jump again to perform a &quot;high-jump&quot;!<br>Master all three jumps to overcome tricky obstacles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.poster.avif?t=1753344088\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.webm?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.mp4?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but fun</strong><br>The stages offer a bit of a challenge, but there's no damage or game over.<br>You can retry as many times as you like, making it easy to enjoy even for players who aren't confident in action games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable pixel-art maid</strong><br>The maid is brought to life with charming pixel art.<br>Her tiny, busy movements are irresistibly cute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blend of 2D and 3D in a whimsical world</strong><br>Pixel-art characters meet 3D-crafted backgrounds to create a strange but adorable world that gives the game its unique charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a bit tough, but you'll keep coming back for more.<br>Run, jump, and explore the dream world together with the cute maid!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2285990?t=1753344088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2285990?t=1753344088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/bf7602641400920264d960b55ffd5466f86cd9ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753344088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/bf7602641400920264d960b55ffd5466f86cd9ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753344088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dreamy adventure begins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maid, dozing off during her break, finds herself in a mysterious dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Up Step Maid</i> is a 2D action game where you use three types of jumps to make your way through whimsical stages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump through with three types of jumps</strong><br>If you press the jump button again just as you land from a normal jump, you'll perform a &quot;mid-jump.&quot;<br>Land from a mid-jump and press jump again to perform a &quot;high-jump&quot;!<br>Master all three jumps to overcome tricky obstacles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.poster.avif?t=1753344088\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.webm?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/extras/f17ba0eaf5ca58899303a4568e986769.mp4?t=1753344088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging but fun</strong><br>The stages offer a bit of a challenge, but there's no damage or game over.<br>You can retry as many times as you like, making it easy to enjoy even for players who aren't confident in action games.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable pixel-art maid</strong><br>The maid is brought to life with charming pixel art.<br>Her tiny, busy movements are irresistibly cute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blend of 2D and 3D in a whimsical world</strong><br>Pixel-art characters meet 3D-crafted backgrounds to create a strange but adorable world that gives the game its unique charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a bit tough, but you'll keep coming back for more.<br>Run, jump, and explore the dream world together with the cute maid!</p>","developers":["MatabbyGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2285990/7d99a0899017777931db2dacbcadf69f6ca753eb/header.jpg?t=1753344088","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2285990/1244865780/f66fdc7c70d07f297fac53aa2a8659840145120d/1